    "derivation": "Victims, in the C's order: buoy subentity at (1000, 2000, -3000), mass 7646.7861328125 kg, radius 25.822647094726562 m: desired_range = f(radius x 2.5f) = 64.5566177368164 (ShipEntity.m:8124), amount = f(0.125f x mass) = 955.8482666015625 (8125); buoy (subentity gone) at (1000, 2000, -3000), mass 691044.375 kg, radius 59.13554763793945 m: desired_range = f(radius x 2.5f) = 147.8388671875 (ShipEntity.m:8124), amount = f(0.125f x mass) = 86380.546875 (8125). The C's order: the parent's becomeExplosion explodes its subentities first (ShipEntity.m:8114-8118); the subentity's own becomeExplosion takes its absolute position, at the buoy's centre (subentity position (0, 0, 0), shipdata.plist:1042-1049), calls subEntityDied, which lowers the parent's mass by the subentity's: f(698691.1875 - 7646.7861328125) = 691044.375 (7894-7903, 8185-8194), and deals its own blast with its mass 7646.7861328125 and radius 25.822647094726562 (sqrtf of the largest vertex magnitude2 of oolite_buoy_subents.dat, OOMesh.m:1800-1822). Then clearSubEntities (8120) resets the parent's mass to density x 20 x octree volume, the compiled hull mass 691044.375 (equal to the subtraction), and its radius to the hull mesh's 59.13554763793945 (1066-1078), before the parent's own blast (8123-8126). The parent is STATUS_DEAD (7924) when the subentity explodes, and the subentity is dead when the parent's blast runs, so neither receives the other's (isInSpace, Entity.m:1033-1046). Receiver pod at (1060, 2080, -3000), mass 993.3700561523438 kg, radius 5.798625946044922 m: from the buoy subentity: HPdistance2 is not below f((range + 5.798625946044922)^2), out of range, no push (Universe.m:5862-5868); from the buoy (subentity gone): in range; d2 = magnitude2(p2) - 5.798625946044922^2 (the receiver's radius, 7685-7687) = 9966.375937137855; moment = 86380.546875 x 147.8388671875 / 9966.375937137855 = 1281.3486344068363 (7691); dv = vector_normal(p2) x f(f(moment) / 993.3700561523438) = (0.7739403247833252, 1.0319204330444336, 0) (11178-11181); total (0.7739403247833252, 1.0319204330444336, 0). Receiver player Cobra Mk III at (1000, 2000, -3100), mass 214737.6875 kg, radius 72.69734954833984 m: from the buoy subentity: in range; d2 = magnitude2(p2) - 72.69734954833984^2 (the receiver's radius, 7685-7687) = 4715.095368646493; moment = 955.8482666015625 x 64.5566177368164 / 4715.095368646493 = 13.086974140908833 (7691); dv = vector_normal(p2) x f(f(moment) / 214737.6875) = (0, 0, -0.00006094400305300951) (11178-11181); from the buoy (subentity gone): in range; d2 = magnitude2(p2) - 72.69734954833984^2 (the receiver's radius, 7685-7687) = 4715.095368646493; moment = 86380.546875 x 147.8388671875 / 4715.095368646493 = 2708.408038139554 (7691); dv = vector_normal(p2) x f(f(moment) / 214737.6875) = (0, 0, -0.012612634338438511) (11178-11181); total (0, 0, -0.01267357834149152).",
